  "problem": "What is the range of $f(x)=\\sqrt[7]{4x+12}-25?$\n\n{{field-1}}\n$<f(x)$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}",
  "worked_solution": "The range of $y=\\sqrt[7]{x}$ is\n$-\\infty <y<\\infty .$\nTransformations do not change this interval. Therefore, the range of the given function is \n\n$$\n-\\infty <f(x)<\\infty .\n$$",
